   "Cross out toluidine blue: it produces false positives and false negatives, and would not replace tissue diagnosis in either case.",
   "Cross out antifungal with review: Candida can colonise a speckled lesion, but antifungals do not rule out dysplasia, and the 6-month delay is unsafe.",
